ly, Bronx,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6685423503354714, "w": 0.8074653647637933, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Queens and Staten Island had only 18.701. Manhattan has almost three times", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.696872700409609, "w": 0.8070284034106772, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "more than group of other four cities also. It had 76% of population in New York.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7252031259265317, "w": 0.8068327857988176, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It tells us Manhattan was the busiest city in New York. In 1900, Manhattan's", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7535334760006693, "w": 0.8076478591815659, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "populat increased sharply however, other broughs had bigger change.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7817155055594542, "w": 0.8070938143312046, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Population rate rise dramatically as 1587.109.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8100458556335919, "w": 0.46656466459012624, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "In 2000 other broughs had 6471.089 and 81% of population of New York. On the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8383762057077295, "w": 0.8070067706454244, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "other hand Manhattan's population has dicreased and it became only 19% of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8667313764581392, "w": 0.8075583548968942, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "New York population. Last 200 years people chose to live differant cities in New", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8950617265322769, "w": 0.8072248412221672, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "York.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9233920766064145, 